cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use frick-fsw in your research or mission, please cite it as follows."
title: "frick-fsw"
abstract: >-
  cFS-inspired flight software framework delivering PUS-C TM/TC on CCSDS Space
  Packets for a small/medium spacecraft OBC (Microchip RT PolarFire SoC
  RTPFS160ZT, RISC-V, RTEMS 6.2), target ECSS criticality B, with Lean 4 formal
  verification and Docker-based V&V. The V&V image inputs are mutable, so
  reproducibility is not established (NC-EXT-35). The repository owner has
  authorized MPL-2.0 for original project-authored code and materials created for
  frick-fsw; third-party/generated-code disposition remains open under NC-EXT-43.
  This citation describes the historical v0.1.0 release (2026-10-10), which
  predates that transition; this metadata does not change prior grants.
authors:
  - family-names: "ilfrick"
    given-names: "FSW Team"
    affiliation: "frick-fsw project"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-10
keywords:
  - flight software
  - PUS-C
  - CCSDS
  - RTEMS
  - RISC-V
  - PolarFire SoC
  - ECSS
  - formal verification
  - Lean 4
repository-code: "https://github.com/ilfrick/frick-fsw"
url: "https://www.housefz.com/git/ilfrick/frick-fsw"
